[https://techdocs.akamai.com/ion/docs/set-up-adaptive-acceleration#whats-compressed-1]

But the standard MIME type for Protocol Buffers is *application/protobuf** [https://protobuf.dev/reference/protobuf/mime-types/. |https://protobuf.dev/reference/protobuf/mime-types/]And this one is not included in the pearl.

*Is this a typo? Can you help with fixing?*

[NBCUniversal Media, LLC|https://akamai.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Account/001A0000004ukE4IAI/view]

NBC complained today about some 500 errors while checking we noticed some [ERR_G2G_AUTH|https://collaborate.akamai.com/confluence/display/AKATEC/Ghost+Errors+Reference#GhostErrorsReference-ERR_G2G_AUTH|httpReadReply] httpReadReply from Edge peer.

